{"synopsis":"Dari penulis yang sama, Return of the Mount Hua Sect!\n\nSang pendekar agung yang mengakhiri kekacauan yang melanda dunia, dialah Wi Yeonho, Sang Kaisar Bela Diri yang Cemerlang.\n\nIa dikenal sebagai seorang pria terhormat, sosok agung, dan pendekar ksatria...\n\n“Orang itu? Dia bajingan sejati.”\n\nKebenaran mengejutkan yang terlalu memalukan untuk diungkap ke dunia, tentang sosok yang disebut-sebut sebagai pendekar paling ksatria dalam sejarah, akhirnya terungkap!","alternative_title":"태존비록, Kisah Bangsawan Pemalas","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"49e6ac65-e764-4efa-8443-d3ba57c95d25","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"d48cf0c0-618c-4bbe-b6d8-0ad885a834c7","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"03edc524-bb1b-41de-a9fe-f198e9f252fa","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"bd734961-9e9e-45c1-841c-c71140813798","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"088f03ee-54d2-4106-a8cb-f80ae2f5306c","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"aefa355c-bd86-4050-b704-f46a058fa13f","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"507da403-a5c8-47e5-a488-e01dc20bda08","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"b2cb917e-6bf2-48de-a5f1-2f2e06c2da52","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"742f0ddf-d474-4f21-a0c0-f64d09251c95","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"0aab6cba-d8a5-4ba7-a6dc-6055198369a3","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"5696b5bf-ea9d-45dc-821b-d919e7bc7c1c","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"086ad5a7-b256-4bc8-96d0-b1ad5a4d796f","date":"2026-05-10","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"3a31fc72-9124-49d1-8360-adccf412e25b","date":"2026-05-03","image